
@host = http://localhost:5290

### Register a new user
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "01712345678",
  "password": "TestUser@123"
}


### 1. Login using Email
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@123"
}

### 2. Login using Phone Number
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01712345678",
  "password": "TestUser@123"
}


@host = http://localhost:5290

### 1. Access token ছাড়া profile access
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login to receive JWT token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@123"
}


### 2. Create booking using JWT
POST {{host}}/api/booking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "Test Passenger",
  "busId": "1636fc26-bb71-484f-87ac-06a82f043c79",
  "seatNumber": "E1"
}


### 3. Cancel your own booking
DELETE {{host}}/api/booking/f1c37cda-92ae-4eb5-96fe-cc1f30e8b19a
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Try cancelling without a token
DELETE {{host}}/api/booking/f1c37cda-92ae-4eb5-96fe-cc1f30e8b19a


### 3. Access profile using JWT token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
